			"notes": "# Visbarrier 2.0.0\nComplete overhaul of original mod using fork of [Diabet's mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/visible-barriers) as base\n\n## Reworks\n- Smooth rerender to avoid reloading all chunks from scratch\n- Default barrier texture change focusing on outline\n- Keeping chat notification from previous iteration\n- Utilizing resource packs for easily changeable textures/models\n\nNew default texture:\n\n![texture](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa3cfe3c3eae4f0c8f2a545ae95a0246f3defb54_0.webp)"
